   "Sources: Bokmalsordboka, Sprakradet and the University of Bergen",
   "(https://ordbokene.no/bm/search?q=formiddag), which gives formiddag as",
   "the \"tid mellom frokost og klokka tolv eller middagstid\"."
  ],
  "daypart_kveld_nb": [
   "Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale no",
   "(https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),",
