  "marker_clock_lead": [
   "Words that open a clock time and belong to it. They fold only in front of",
   "a number, a clock time, a clock fraction or a clock landmark.",
   "Each word is shown opening a clock time on the page named in brackets,",
   "saved under knowledge/wiki/audits/chronologia/parity-fixes/marker-strand/sources/ in the workspace.",
   "klokka: Wiktionary \"klokka\": \"time on a clock: o'clock: klokka seks\" [nb-klokka.wikitext.txt]",
   "klokken: Wiktionary \"klokken\": \"time on a clock: o'clock: klokken seks\" [nb-klokken.wikitext.txt]",
   "kl: Wiktionary \"kl.\": \"Møtet er kl. 12.\" [nb-kl.wikitext.txt]"
  ],
